<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY'S BUX ENDS OFFICIALLY AT 5,881.55 PTS.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY'S BUX ENDS OFFICIALLY AT 5,881.55 PTS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The BUX index of the Budapest Stock Exchange finished fficially at 5,881.55 points, up 9.16, unchanged from the preliminary figures.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover totalled 4.34 billion forints.</p>
<p>BUX futures edged lower for four maturities and firmed for two. June BUX finished at 6,085 points, down 20.00</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
